     <article class="story single" data-beat="finance">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">FINANCE</span> · Livemint Money · 2026-10-11 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Amazon KDP enables free book publishing and royalties</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#finance</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing (KDP) allows writers to publish eBooks, paperbacks, and hardcovers without upfront fees. Authors manage their own manuscripts, covers, and pricing, with KDP providing tools like Kindle Create to assist in formatting and layout. </p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-11/amazon-kdp-enables-free-book-publishing-and-royalties.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Authors can choose between two royalty models: a 70% option for books priced between $2.99 and $12.99, or a 35% option for books priced between $0.99 and $200. Writers must complete an author profile, provide tax and banking details, and select keywords to help readers find their work. KDP also offers an optional enrollment in KDP Select, allowing Kindle Unlimited subscribers to read the content based on page-read earnings.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief provides a clear, concise overview of the KDP publishing process and royalty models.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.livemint.com/money/publish-your-book-for-free-and-start-earning-what-is-amazon-kdp-here-s-how-it-works-11791734305904.html" rel="noopener">Livemint Money</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-11/amazon-kdp-enables-free-book-publishing-and-royalties" data-title="Amazon KDP enables free book publishing and royalties"><b>Share:</b>
