      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/companies/news/around-1-000-ex-flipkart-staff-approach-walmart-over-stock-option-liquidity-126101100585_1.html" rel="noopener">Business Standard</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
