       <h1>BBC Sport Launches Daily Sports Quizzes</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#sports</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>BBC Sport has introduced a suite of interactive daily quizzes for sports fans, including &quot;Who Am I?&quot;, &quot;Five in Five,&quot; and various brainteasers. The &quot;Who Am I?&quot; segment challenges users to identify a footballer through a series of increasingly specific clues, with points awarded based on the efficiency of the guess. </p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-11/bbc-sport-launches-daily-sports-quizzes.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Users can access these challenges via the dedicated Football Quizzes and Sports Quizzes pages on the BBC Sport website. The platform also offers notifications to ensure participants receive updates on the latest daily content. Additionally, a new quiz regarding the 10 Lionesses with the most England caps was recently published.</p>
