     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-11 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Delhi Police Release Video Regarding Abhijeet Dipke Detention</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Delhi Police released video footage showing officers informing Cockroach Janta Party founder Abhijeet Dipke of his grandmother’s death while he was in detention. Officials stated that they offered him assistance with travel, phone calls, and arrangements to attend the funeral in Maharashtra, but Dipke declined the help.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-11/delhi-police-release-video-regarding-abhijeet-dipke-detentio.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The police released the video to counter allegations from Dipke’s mother, who claimed the family was unable to contact her son. Dipke was detained on October 10 alongside two other party leaders while traveling for a planned protest at Jantar Mantar, which had been denied permission by authorities.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Excellent summary of the incident, police response, and context provided in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/cjp-misrepresented-matter-delhi-police-releases-video-of-abhijeet-dipkes-detention-10377078.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/delhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Delhi</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
