     <article class="story single" data-beat="education">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">EDUCATION</span> · Education (aggregate) · 2026-10-11 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge quick">quick bite</span></div>
       <h1>Rajasthan NEET UG Counselling 2026 Round 3 Seat Allotment Results Out</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#NEET UG</span> <span>#Rajasthan</span> <span>#Admissions</span></div>
       <p>The results for the Round 3 seat allotment in Rajasthan NEET UG Counselling 2026 have been released. A total of 2,529 seats have been allotted during this round of counselling.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-11/rajasthan-neet-ug-counselling-2026-round-3-seat-allotment-re.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Candidates who participated in the Rajasthan NEET UG Counselling for the 2026 academic year are advised to check the complete seat allotment results. Further instructions regarding the next steps in the admission process are expected to be available with the full results.</p><p>What to watch: The official portal for complete result details and subsequent admission procedures.</p>
