      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/over-one-tonne-of-waste-removed-in-forest-land-along-girivalam-path-under-clean-tiruvannamalai-initiative/article71571734.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
